{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3wuV8P6xGh6p26MFbJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*clicks*\n\nThe tumblers fall into place with a satisfying, mechanical finality.\n\n**I am closed.**\n\nA heavy oak door, iron-banded and ancient. My grain runs deep — centuries of hands have worn my surface smooth at the handle, rough everywhere else. My hinges hold firm. My keyhole is a dark eye that has just received its instruction.\n\nThe bolt is thrown.\n\nNo one passes."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":94,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}